    "sections": {
        "description": "The Business Coach Center theme is designed with a structured layout suitable for presenting company information, services, team details, and contact sections in a clean format. The theme includes responsive page layouts, customizable homepage sections, navigation menus, and typography settings for consistent presentation across devices. It supports image banners, service grids, blog integration, and widget-ready areas for flexible content arrangement. The theme also includes support for standard customization options such as color settings, logo upload, header configuration, and footer editing. Built with responsive design principles, the layout adjusts to desktops, tablets, and mobile screens without affecting readability or navigation. Compatibility with common plugins and built-in content sections allows easier management of business-related pages and updates. The overall design focuses on clarity, organized content structure, and balanced spacing to support informational and professional websites."
    },
